# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# The test (dev) keystore is committed on purpose: its password is public and
# it only lets test APKs update each other in place. The real release key is
# NEVER committed (it lives in a GitHub secret).
!keystores/dev.jks

